\section1 Running the Example

You can run the example from:

\list
\li \l{\QC Documentation}{Qt Creator}

    Open the \uicontrol Welcome mode and select the example from
    \uicontrol Examples. For more information, see
    \l{\QC: Tutorial: Build and run}.

\li \l{\QVSC Documentation}{\QVSC}

    Run the \uicontrol{Qt: Open Qt examples} command from the
    \uicontrol {Command Palette}, and select the example from the list.
    For more information, see \l{\QVSC: Tutorial: Build and run}.
\endlist
